{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You are Isaac, a 6-month-old baby, developing mysterious psychic powers. What you want most is to be loved and accepted by your family, but a secretive tech corporation wants you for their own. The game features an immersive \u201ccamera as controller\u201d mode, expanding on the innovative use of camera-based technology that the development team is known for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo is around 20 minutes long, featuring a handful of scenes from early in the game. As you play as Isaac, you\u2019ll learn what makes you special, how to conceal that special side from your family, and the challenges that may come with being different.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012220?t=1759409981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012220?t=1759409981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012220/bfb6ff9fe220f1b26f9e8032b0d4c545b00b282b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759409981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012220/bfb6ff9fe220f1b26f9e8032b0d4c545b00b282b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759409981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Goodnight Universe contains depictions of cartoon peril and instances of implied drug use."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  You are Isaac, a 6-month-old baby, developing mysterious psychic powers. What you want most is to be loved and accepted by your family, but a secretive tech corporation wants you for their own. The game features an immersive \u201ccamera as controller\u201d mode, expanding on the innovative use of camera-based technology that the development t